Error [E0109]: `+` can't compare or combine [Int] and [Int]
  --> compound_non_arithmetic_place.jet:6:11
    |
  6 |     items += [3]
    |           ^^
 Why: `+` is not defined for [Int]
 Fix: Use an operation supported by [Int], or call a named method
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0109

